      "content": "redefining it just sounds like more work. another project to manage, another way to lie to myself so i can keep going. but what if there isn't anything to redefine? what if the nothingness isn't a phase or a problem to solve, but just... the reality? it feels like the most honest thing i've ever felt. like the only real thing.",
